    m_Localized: Los enemigos resisten {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883363307127525
  - m_Id: 6120950923694126
    m_Localized: "{0} inflige {1} de da\xF1o a Seraphel. PV {2}/{3}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7214883363307127525
  - m_Id: 6120950923694127
    m_Localized: 'SERAPHEL - FASE II: Luz Implacable. Fuerza 10, D12, inmune a debilitaciones
      y aplica dos Sellos.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
