    m_Localized: adventure.tutorial.module.{moduleId}.subtitle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143197
    m_Localized: adventure.tutorial.module.{moduleId}.intro
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143198
    m_Localized: adventure.chapter.{chapterId}.title
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143199
    m_Localized: talents.branch.{id}.name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143200
    m_Localized: talents.node.{id}.name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143201
    m_Localized: talents.node.{id}.description
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143202
    m_Localized: talents.node.{id}.value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143203
    m_Localized: 'Lezione non disponibile: mancano le carte Ladro nel database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143204
    m_Localized: 'Lesson unavailable: Thief cards are missing from the database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143205
    m_Localized: Lezione - Il Ladro
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143206
    m_Localized: Lesson - The Thief
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143207
    m_Localized: IL MANA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143208
    m_Localized: MANA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143209
    m_Localized: 'Le abilita'' si pagano in mana. La riserva non supera i 10 punti
      e si recupera fra una stanza e l''altra, non a ogni turno: spenderlo bene e''
      meta'' del gioco.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143210
    m_Localized: 'Abilities cost mana. Your reserve cannot exceed 10 points and recovers
      between rooms, not every turn: spending it wisely is half the game.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143211
    m_Localized: LA TECNICA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143212
    m_Localized: THE TECHNIQUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143213
    m_Localized: L'AURA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143214
    m_Localized: THE AURA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143215
    m_Localized: IL TRIANGOLO DELLE FAZIONI
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143216
    m_Localized: THE FACTION TRIANGLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143217
    m_Localized: 'Ora le conosci tutte e tre: Forzuta batte Astuta, Astuta batte
      Magica, Magica batte Forzuta. Il triangolo si chiude, e nessuna fazione e''
      la piu'' forte.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143218
    m_Localized: 'Now you know all three: Might beats Cunning, Cunning beats Magic,
      and Magic beats Might. The triangle is complete, and no faction is the strongest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143219
    m_Localized: I COLORI DEL BERSAGLIO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143220
    m_Localized: TARGET COLORS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143221
    m_Localized: 'Quando provi ad attaccare, si accende un''aura intorno alle pedine
      nemiche: verde significa che hai vantaggio, gialla che siete della stessa fazione,
      rossa che hai svantaggio.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143222
    m_Localized: 'When you attack, an aura appears around enemy pawns: green means
      you have advantage, yellow means both belong to the same faction, and red means
      you have disadvantage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143223
    m_Localized: tira il dado Vigore piu' un dado di uno step inferiore e li somma
      alla potenza
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143224
    m_Localized: roll the Vigor die plus a die one step lower and add both results
      to Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143225
    m_Localized: abbassa di uno step il dado Vigore di un nemico per il suo prossimo
      combattimento
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143226
    m_Localized: reduce an enemy's Vigor die by one step for its next combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143227
    m_Localized: attiva l'effetto della sua classe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143228
    m_Localized: activate the class effect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143229
    m_Localized: ' E'' l''abilita'' piu'' cara del gioco: mezza riserva in un colpo,
      quindi si usa quando conta.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143230
    m_Localized: ' It is the most expensive ability in the game: half your reserve
      at once, so use it when it matters.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143231
    m_Localized: L'ABILITA'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143232
    m_Localized: THE ABILITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143233
    m_Localized: '{0}: premi ABILITA'' e {1}. Costa {2} mana.{3}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143234
    m_Localized: '{0}: press ABILITY and {1}. It costs {2} mana.{3}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143235
    m_Localized: quando tira male, ritira il dado da solo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143236
    m_Localized: when it rolls poorly, it rerolls the die automatically
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143237
    m_Localized: accumula furia quando una pedina cade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143238
    m_Localized: build Fury whenever a pawn falls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143239
    m_Localized: agisce da solo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143240
    m_Localized: trigger automatically
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143241
    m_Localized: UN'ABILITA' CHE NON SI PREME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143242
    m_Localized: AN ABILITY YOU DO NOT PRESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143243
    m_Localized: '{0} non ha un pulsante ABILITA'': la sua e'' passiva. {1}, sempre,
      senza costare mana.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143244
    m_Localized: '{0} has no ABILITY button: its ability is passive. It will {1},
      at all times and without spending mana.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143245
    m_Localized: 'Ogni classe ha una seconda abilita'', la suprema. Quella del {0}
      e'' {1} ({2} mana): {3}


      Qui te la faccio provare, ma non e'' ancora
      tua: si impara al Santuario, all''altare delle Tecniche.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143246
    m_Localized: 'Every class has a second ability: its Supreme. The {0}''s Supreme
      is {1} ({2} mana): {3}


      You can try it here, but you do not own it yet.
      Learn it at the Techniques altar in the Sanctuary.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143247
    m_Localized: '{0} appartiene alla fazione {1}, che batte {2} e perde contro {3}.
      Chi ha vantaggio tira due dadi Vigore e tiene il migliore; chi ha svantaggio
      tiene il peggiore.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143248
    m_Localized: '{0} belongs to the {1} faction, which beats {2} and loses to {3}.
      With advantage, roll two Vigor dice and keep the higher result; with disadvantage,
      keep the lower result.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143249
    m_Localized: 'Lezione del Mago non disponibile: mancano le pedine nel database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143250
    m_Localized: 'Magician lesson unavailable: pawns are missing from the database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143251
    m_Localized: THE MAGICIAN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143252
    m_Localized: Impariamo il mago. Userai prima l'attacco base, poi l'abilita' del
      Mago e infine la sua Suprema contro una nuova ondata di nemici.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143253
    m_Localized: Learn how to use the Magician. First use a basic attack, then the
      Magician's ability, and finally its Supreme against a new wave of enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143254
    m_Localized: Lezione - Il Mago
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143255
    m_Localized: Lesson - The Magician
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143256
    m_Localized: ATTACCO BASE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143257
    m_Localized: BASIC ATTACK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143258
    m_Localized: Cominciamo dal colpo normale. Premi CONTINUA, poi ATTACCA e scegli
      soltanto la pedina Mago da 2.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143259
    m_Localized: Start with a normal strike. Press CONTINUE, then ATTACK, and select
      only the Power-2 Magician pawn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143260
    m_Localized: ABILITA' DEL MAGO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143261
    m_Localized: MAGICIAN ABILITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143262
    m_Localized: Ora usa ABILITA' sulla pedina Mago da 4. Costa {0} mana e abbassa
      di uno step il suo prossimo dado Vigore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143263
    m_Localized: Now use ABILITY on the Power-4 Magician pawn. It costs {0} mana
      and reduces its next Vigor die by one step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143264
    m_Localized: SFRUTTA IL MALUS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143265
    m_Localized: EXPLOIT THE PENALTY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143266
    m_Localized: Il suo dado Vigore e' stato ridotto. Premi CONTINUA, poi ATTACCA
      e colpisci la stessa pedina da 4.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143267
    m_Localized: Its Vigor die has been reduced. Press CONTINUE, then ATTACK, and
      strike the same Power-4 pawn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143268
    m_Localized: 'NUOVA ONDATA: SUPREMA'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143269
    m_Localized: 'NEW WAVE: SUPREME'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143270
    m_Localized: 'Sono comparse altre tre pedine Mago. Premi CONTINUA e usa SUPREMA:
      Palla di Fuoco costa {0} mana e affronta tutti i nemici insieme.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143271
    m_Localized: 'Three more Magician pawns have appeared. Press CONTINUE and use
      SUPREME: Fireball costs {0} mana and attacks all enemies at once.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143272
    m_Localized: LEZIONE DEL MAGO COMPLETATA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143273
    m_Localized: MAGICIAN LESSON COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143274
    m_Localized: Hai usato attacco base, abilita' e Suprema del Mago. Premi CONTINUA
      per ricevere la ricompensa e proseguire verso il Ladro.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143275
    m_Localized: You used the Magician's basic attack, ability, and Supreme. Press
      CONTINUE to receive your reward and continue toward the Thief.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143276
    m_Localized: VEDIAMO IL LADRO IN AZIONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143277
    m_Localized: SEE THE THIEF IN ACTION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143278
    m_Localized: 'Vediamo l''abilita'' passiva del Ladro in azione: combattiamo!
      Attaccherai una pedina per ogni fazione e vedrai un tiro basso trasformarsi
      in una vittoria grazie al reroll.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143279
    m_Localized: 'See the Thief''s passive ability in action: let us fight! You will
      attack one pawn from each faction and watch a low roll turn into a victory
      thanks to the reroll.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143280
    m_Localized: 'STESSA FAZIONE: GIALLO'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143281
    m_Localized: 'SAME FACTION: YELLOW'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143282
    m_Localized: 'Il primo tiro avrebbe perso, ma il Ladro lo ha ritirato e ha vinto.
      Ora ripetiamo contro il Ladro: l''aura gialla indica la stessa fazione.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143283
    m_Localized: 'The first roll would have lost, but the Thief rerolled it and won.
      Now repeat the attack against the Thief: the yellow aura indicates the same
      faction.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143284
    m_Localized: 'SVANTAGGIO: ROSSO'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143285
    m_Localized: 'DISADVANTAGE: RED'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143286
    m_Localized: 'Anche il secondo scontro e'' stato ribaltato dal reroll. Ora attacca
      il Guerriero: l''aura rossa indica svantaggio, ma la passiva puo'' ancora salvare
      un tiro basso.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143287
    m_Localized: 'The reroll also turned the second fight around. Now attack the
      Warrior: the red aura indicates disadvantage, but the passive ability can still
      save a low roll.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143288
    m_Localized: STAI ANDANDO ALLA GRANDE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143289
    m_Localized: YOU ARE DOING GREAT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143290
    m_Localized: Hai la stoffa adatta! Vai nel Negozio per ottenere la tua ricompensa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143291
    m_Localized: You have what it takes! Go to the Shop to receive your reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143292
    m_Localized: TUTORIAL MAGO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143293
    m_Localized: MAGICIAN TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143294
    m_Localized: TUTORIAL LADRO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143295
    m_Localized: THIEF TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143296
    m_Localized: TUTORIAL GUERRIERO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143297
    m_Localized: WARRIOR TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143298
    m_Localized: 'Lezione non disponibile: mancano le carte nel database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143299
    m_Localized: 'Lesson unavailable: required cards are missing from the database.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143300
    m_Localized: BENVENUTO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143301
    m_Localized: WELCOME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143302
    m_Localized: 'Sei in una stanza guidata: ti spiego alcuni elementi dell''interfaccia
      e poi combattiamo insieme.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143303
    m_Localized: 'This is a guided room: I will explain a few interface elements,
      then we will fight together.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143304
    m_Localized: Lezione - Il Guerriero
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143305
    m_Localized: Lesson - The Warrior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143306
    m_Localized: LA RISERVA DI MANA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143307
    m_Localized: THE MANA POOL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143308
    m_Localized: "Quella blu \xE8 la tua riserva di mana, quella rossa \xE8 dell'avversario.
      Il mana serve per usare abilit\xE0, supreme e attacchi base. Si recupera parando
      o alla fine del proprio turno."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143309
    m_Localized: The blue pool is your mana; the red one belongs to your opponent.
      Mana powers abilities, supreme techniques, and basic attacks. You recover it
      when you block or at the end of your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951624143310
    m_Localized: I DADI VIGORE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531456
    m_Localized: VIGOR DICE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531457
    m_Localized: "Queste due icone mostrano il tuo dado Vigore e quello dell'avversario.
      A ogni scontro entrambi lo tirano e sommano il risultato alla Potenza della
      propria pedina: vince il totale pi\xF9 alto."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531458
    m_Localized: These icons show your Vigor die and your opponent's. In each clash,
      both dice are rolled and added to the pawn's Power. The highest total wins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531459
    m_Localized: "ATTACCA IL PI\xD9 DEBOLE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531460
    m_Localized: ATTACK THE WEAKEST
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531461
    m_Localized: "Attacca il mostro con Potenza 4: sei pi\xF9 forte e hai poche probabilit\xE0
      di perdere. Premi ATTACCA e seleziona la pedina con Potenza 4."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531462
    m_Localized: Attack the monster with 4 Power. You are stronger and unlikely to
      lose. Press ATTACK and select the pawn with 4 Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531463
    m_Localized: "PROVA COL PI\xD9 FORTE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531464
    m_Localized: TRY THE STRONGEST
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531465
    m_Localized: 'Resta il Guerriero da 10. Tu sei un 6: attaccalo e guarda cosa
      succede.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531466
    m_Localized: 'The 10-Power Warrior remains. You have 6 Power: attack him and
      see what happens.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531467
    m_Localized: ORA RIPROVA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531468
    m_Localized: NOW TRY AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531469
    m_Localized: "Stessa pedina, stesso attacco base: l'unica cosa cambiata \xE8
      la tua Potenza. Colpisci il Guerriero da 10."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531470
    m_Localized: 'Same pawn, same basic attack: only your Power has changed. Strike
      the 10-Power Warrior.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531471
    m_Localized: LEZIONE FINITA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531472
    m_Localized: LESSON COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531473
    m_Localized: "Hai visto le tre cose che contano: il mana che paga le abilit\xE0,
      il Colpo pesante che raddoppia i dadi e la tecnica che aumenta la Potenza.
      La suprema per\xF2 non \xE8 ancora tua: si impara al Santuario."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531474
    m_Localized: 'You have seen the three essentials: mana pays for abilities, Heavy
      Strike doubles the dice, and the technique raises Power. The supreme technique
      is not yours yet: you learn it at the Sanctuary.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531475
    m_Localized: "L'ABILIT\xC0 DEL GUERRIERO"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531476
    m_Localized: THE WARRIOR'S ABILITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531477
    m_Localized: "Il Guerriero da 4 \xE8 a terra. Il prossimo \xE8 un 7 e con la
      sola Potenza perderesti. Premi ABILIT\xC0: Colpo pesante costa {0} mana, tira
      due dadi Vigore e ne somma i risultati."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531478
    m_Localized: 'The 4-Power Warrior is down. The next has 7 Power, and Power alone
      would not be enough. Press ABILITY: Heavy Strike costs {0} mana, rolls two
      Vigor dice, and adds their results.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531479
    m_Localized: MATEMATICAMENTE IMPOSSIBILE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531480
    m_Localized: MATHEMATICALLY IMPOSSIBLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531481
    m_Localized: 'Hai ottenuto il massimo del Vigore, 4, ma 6 + 4 arriva soltanto
      a 10. Il Guerriero da 10 ottiene almeno 1 e arriva a 11: con un D4 non puoi
      superarlo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531482
    m_Localized: You rolled the maximum Vigor result, 4, but 6 + 4 only reaches 10.
      The 10-Power Warrior rolls at least 1 and reaches 11, so you cannot beat him
      with a D4.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531483
    m_Localized: LA SUPREMA DEL GUERRIERO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531484
    m_Localized: THE WARRIOR'S SUPREME TECHNIQUE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531485
    m_Localized: "Le Supreme sono tecniche speciali che si sbloccano al Santuario.
      In questa lezione proverai Potenziamento ({0} mana): aumenta la Potenza di
      2, oppure di 4 se \xE8 l'ultima pedina in campo. Sei rimasto solo, quindi diventi
      un 10. Premi SUPREMA."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531486
    m_Localized: 'Supreme techniques are special moves unlocked at the Sanctuary.
      In this lesson you will try Empowerment ({0} mana): it raises Power by 2, or
      by 4 when this is your last pawn. You are alone, so your Power becomes 10.
      Press SUPREME.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531487
    m_Localized: requiresUpdate
