  - m_Id: 6120951632531540
    m_Localized: IL SECONDO TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531541
    m_Localized: THE SECOND TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531542
    m_Localized: IL TERZO TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531543
    m_Localized: THE THIRD TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531544
    m_Localized: LA TUA PROSSIMA CLASSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531545
    m_Localized: YOUR NEXT CLASS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531546
    m_Localized: COMPRA LA CLASSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531547
    m_Localized: BUY THE CLASS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531548
    m_Localized: USA IL REGALO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531549
    m_Localized: USE YOUR GIFT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531550
    m_Localized: TUTORIAL OGGETTI
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531551
    m_Localized: ITEM TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531552
    m_Localized: IL NEGOZIO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531553
    m_Localized: THE SHOP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531554
    m_Localized: L'OFFERTA DEL GIORNO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531555
    m_Localized: TODAY'S OFFER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531556
    m_Localized: UN REGALO PER IL TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531557
    m_Localized: A GIFT FOR THE TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531558
    m_Localized: Il Santuario e' ora accessibile. Entra e usa il miele ricevuto per
      comprare il Mago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531559
    m_Localized: The Sanctuary is now available. Enter and use the honey you received
      to buy the Magician.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531560
    m_Localized: Entra nel SANTUARIO e usa i 40 vasetti ricevuti per comprare il
      Ladro.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531561
    m_Localized: Enter the SANCTUARY and use the 40 honey jars you received to buy
      the Thief.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531562
    m_Localized: 'Questo e'' il Santuario. Qui si trasforma il miele in cose permanenti:
      classi nuove, tecniche e reliquie. Quello che compri qui resta tuo per sempre,
      anche quando una run finisce male.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531563
    m_Localized: 'This is the Sanctuary. Here, honey becomes permanent upgrades:
      new classes, techniques, and relics. Everything you buy here remains yours,
      even when a run ends badly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531564
    m_Localized: Le CLASSI sono le pedine che potrai schierare. Le TECNICHE sono
      la seconda abilita' di una classe che possiedi gia'. Le RELIQUIE ampliano la
      bisaccia e il banco del Mercato.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531565
    m_Localized: CLASSES are the pawns you can deploy. TECHNIQUES are the second
      ability of a class you already own. RELICS expand your bag and the Market bench.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531566
    m_Localized: 'Tutto qui dentro si paga in vasetti di miele. Non si trovano giocando:
      si guadagnano in taverna, con le quest del giorno. Durante il tutorial te li
      do io, giusti per quello che serve.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531567
    m_Localized: 'Everything here is paid for with honey jars. You do not find them
      during runs: you earn them in the Tavern by completing daily quests. During
      the tutorial, you receive exactly what you need.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531568
    m_Localized: Il Mago e' stato sbloccato. Entra in CAMPAGNA per raggiungere il
      suo tutorial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531569
    m_Localized: The Magician has been unlocked. Enter CAMPAIGN to reach its tutorial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531570
    m_Localized: Il Ladro e' stato sbloccato. Entra in CAMPAGNA per raggiungere il
      terzo tutorial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531571
    m_Localized: The Thief has been unlocked. Enter CAMPAIGN to reach the third tutorial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531572
    m_Localized: 'Seleziona AVVENTURA: i tutorial delle classi si trovano qui.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531573
    m_Localized: 'Select ADVENTURE: class tutorials are found here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531574
    m_Localized: Seleziona AVVENTURA per tornare ai tutorial delle classi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531575
    m_Localized: Select ADVENTURE to return to the class tutorials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531576
    m_Localized: Seleziona AVVENTURA.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531577
    m_Localized: Select ADVENTURE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531578
    m_Localized: Apri la sezione TUTORIAL per vedere il prossimo modulo disponibile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531579
    m_Localized: Open the TUTORIAL section to see the next available module.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531580
    m_Localized: Apri la sezione TUTORIAL.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531581
    m_Localized: Open the TUTORIAL section.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531582
    m_Localized: Apri la sezione TUTORIAL per vedere la prossima lezione.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531583
    m_Localized: Open the TUTORIAL section to see the next lesson.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531584
    m_Localized: Il Mago e' ora disponibile. Apri il suo tutorial per continuare
      il percorso.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531585
    m_Localized: The Magician is now available. Open its tutorial to continue your
      journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531586
    m_Localized: Il Ladro e' ora disponibile. Apri il suo tutorial per continuare
      il percorso.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531587
    m_Localized: The Thief is now available. Open its tutorial to continue your journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531588
    m_Localized: L'Empower e' nella tua scorta. Entra in CAMPAGNA per raggiungere
      il tutorial sugli oggetti e imparare a usarlo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531589
    m_Localized: Empower is in your inventory. Enter CAMPAIGN to reach the item tutorial
      and learn how to use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531590
    m_Localized: 'Apri OGGETTI: qui userai l''Empower ricevuto dal Negozio.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531591
    m_Localized: 'Open ITEMS: here you will use the Empower received from the Shop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531592
    m_Localized: Nel Negozio puoi comprare gli oggetti consumabili da usare durante
      l'Avventura. Alcuni potenziano un tiro o una stanza, altri ti salvano nei momenti
      piu' difficili.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531593
    m_Localized: In the Shop you can buy consumable items to use during Adventure.
      Some improve a roll or a room, while others save you in the hardest moments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531594
    m_Localized: Ogni giorno alcuni oggetti costano meno, e le copie in offerta sono
      limitate. Vale la pena passare a controllare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531595
    m_Localized: Every day, some items cost less and the discounted stock is limited.
      It is worth checking regularly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531596
    m_Localized: 'Hai ricevuto un Empower. Aumenta di uno step il tuo dado Vigore
      in attacco: nel prossimo tutorial lo metteremo nella bisaccia e lo useremo
      sul campo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531597
    m_Localized: 'You received an Empower. It increases your attack Vigor die by
      one step: in the next tutorial, you will put it in your bag and use it in the
      field.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531598
    m_Localized: Hai sbloccato l'accesso al Santuario e hai ricevuto
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531599
    m_Localized: You unlocked access to the Sanctuary and received {amount} honey
      jars. To access the next tutorial, buy the Magician in the Sanctuary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531600
    m_Localized: Hai completato il tutorial del Mago e hai ricevuto
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531601
    m_Localized: You completed the Magician tutorial and received {amount} honey
      jars. Use them to buy the Thief in the Sanctuary and unlock the third tutorial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531602
    m_Localized: Con i vasetti che hai appena ricevuto puoi prendere
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531603
    m_Localized: Ladro
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531604
    m_Localized: the Thief
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531605
    m_Localized: the Magician
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531606
    m_Localized: With the honey jars you just received, you can unlock {className}.
      Open the CLASSES altar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531607
    m_Localized: Scegli il
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531608
    m_Localized: 'Choose {className} and confirm. You have exactly enough honey jars:
      that is the purpose of the gift.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951632531609
    m_Localized: PvP Timer SFX Audio Source
    m_Metadata:
