  - m_Id: 6120951636725888
    m_Localized: 'Malus persistente di Seraphel: il boss ottiene +{0} contro questa
      carta. Al terzo Sigillo la carta viene eliminata automaticamente.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951636725889
    m_Localized: 'Seraphel''s persistent penalty: the boss gains +{0} against this
      card. At the third Seal, the card is eliminated automatically.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951636725890
    m_Localized: "Seraphels dauerhafter Malus: Der Boss erh\xE4lt +{0} gegen diese
      Karte. Beim dritten Siegel wird die Karte automatisch eliminiert."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951636725891
    m_Localized: "Penalizaci\xF3n persistente de Seraphel: el jefe obtiene +{0} contra
      esta carta. Al tercer Sello, la carta se elimina autom\xE1ticamente."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
