    m_Localized: 'SERAPHEL: Juicio de Luz sobre {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951640920176
    m_Localized: "SERAPHEL : Jugement de Lumi\xE8re sur {0}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951640920177
    m_Localized: 'CONDANNA DEI TRE SIGILLI: {0} raggiunge 3 Sigilli e viene eliminata
      automaticamente.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951640920178
    m_Localized: 'THREE-SEAL CONDEMNATION: {0} reaches 3 Seals and is eliminated
      automatically.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951640920179
    m_Localized: 'VERURTEILUNG DER DREI SIEGEL: {0} erreicht 3 Siegel und wird automatisch
      eliminiert.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951640920180
    m_Localized: "CONDENA DE LOS TRES SELLOS: {0} alcanza 3 Sellos y es eliminado
      autom\xE1ticamente."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951640920181
    m_Localized: "CONDAMNATION DES TROIS SCEAUX : {0} atteint 3 Sceaux et est \xE9limin\xE9
      automatiquement."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951640920182
    m_Localized: '{0} resiste al Giudizio di Seraphel. Nessun Sigillo applicato.'
