    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114449
    m_Localized: PREMIERS PAS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114450
    m_Localized: THE FIELD TRIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114451
    m_Localized: "DIE FELDPR\xDCFUNG"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114452
    m_Localized: LA PRUEBA DE CAMPO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114453
    m_Localized: "L'\xC9PREUVE SUR LE TERRAIN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114454
    m_Localized: Prima vai al Negozio e completa la sua visita guidata.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114455
    m_Localized: First visit the Shop and complete its guided tour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114456
    m_Localized: "Besuche zuerst den Shop und schlie\xDFe seine F\xFChrung ab."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114457
    m_Localized: Primero visita la Tienda y completa su recorrido guiado.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114458
    m_Localized: "Visitez d'abord la Boutique et terminez sa visite guid\xE9e."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114459
    m_Localized: "Questo modulo si apre pi\xF9 avanti."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114460
    m_Localized: This module unlocks later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114461
    m_Localized: "Dieses Modul wird sp\xE4ter freigeschaltet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114462
    m_Localized: "Este m\xF3dulo se desbloquea m\xE1s adelante."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114463
    m_Localized: "Ce module se d\xE9bloquera plus tard."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114464
    m_Localized: 'Prima completa: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114465
    m_Localized: 'Complete this first: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114466
    m_Localized: "Schlie\xDFe zuerst {0} ab."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114467
    m_Localized: 'Completa primero: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114468
    m_Localized: 'Terminez d''abord : {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114469
    m_Localized: '{0}. L''hai gia'' completato: puoi rigiocarlo, ma la ricompensa
      e'' gia'' stata consegnata.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114470
    m_Localized: '{0}. You already completed it: you can play it again, but the reward
      has already been granted.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114471
    m_Localized: '{0}. Du hast es bereits abgeschlossen: Du kannst es erneut spielen,
      aber die Belohnung wurde schon vergeben.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114472
    m_Localized: '{0}. Ya lo has completado: puedes volver a jugarlo, pero la recompensa
      ya fue entregada.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114473
    m_Localized: "{0}. Vous l'avez d\xE9j\xE0 termin\xE9 : vous pouvez le rejouer,
      mais la r\xE9compense a d\xE9j\xE0 \xE9t\xE9 accord\xE9e."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114474
    m_Localized: 'La prova pratica: una run guidata dall''inizio alla fine, con me
      che ti indico cosa toccare. Alla fine ricevi il primo capitolo e la Seconda
      Chance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114475
    m_Localized: 'The field trial: a guided run from start to finish, with instructions
      on what to tap. At the end, you receive the first chapter and a Second Chance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114476
    m_Localized: "Die Feldpr\xFCfung: ein gef\xFChrter Lauf von Anfang bis Ende.
      Am Schluss erh\xE4ltst du das erste Kapitel und eine Zweite Chance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114477
    m_Localized: "La prueba de campo: una partida guiada de principio a fin. Al terminar
      recibir\xE1s el primer cap\xEDtulo y una Segunda Oportunidad."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114478
    m_Localized: "L'\xE9preuve sur le terrain : une partie guid\xE9e du d\xE9but
      \xE0 la fin. Vous recevrez ensuite le premier chapitre et une Seconde Chance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114479
    m_Localized: 'Si comincia da qui: il mana, l''abilita'' del Guerriero e la sua
      tecnica. Alla fine il Guerriero e'' tuo, si apre il Santuario e ricevi i vasetti
      per la classe successiva.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114480
    m_Localized: 'Start here: learn about mana, the Warrior''s ability, and his technique.
      At the end, the Warrior is yours, the Sanctuary opens, and you receive honey
      jars for the next class.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114481
    m_Localized: "Beginne hier: Lerne Mana, die F\xE4higkeit und die Technik des
      Kriegers kennen. Danach geh\xF6rt der Krieger dir, das Heiligtum \xF6ffnet
      sich und du erh\xE4ltst Honiggl\xE4ser f\xFCr die n\xE4chste Klasse."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114482
    m_Localized: "Empieza aqu\xED: aprende sobre el man\xE1, la habilidad del Guerrero
      y su t\xE9cnica. Al final, el Guerrero ser\xE1 tuyo, se abrir\xE1 el Santuario
      y recibir\xE1s tarros de miel para la siguiente clase."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114483
    m_Localized: "Commencez ici : d\xE9couvrez le mana, la capacit\xE9 du Guerrier
      et sa technique. \xC0 la fin, le Guerrier sera \xE0 vous, le Sanctuaire s'ouvrira
      et vous recevrez des pots de miel pour la classe suivante."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114484
    m_Localized: L'abilita' del Mago, la Palla di fuoco e l'aura dei Magici. Alla
      fine ricevi i vasetti per la classe successiva.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114485
    m_Localized: Learn the Magician's ability, Fireball, and the Magic faction aura.
      At the end, you receive honey jars for the next class.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114486
    m_Localized: "Lerne die F\xE4higkeit des Magiers, den Feuerball und die Aura
      der magischen Fraktion kennen. Danach erh\xE4ltst du Honiggl\xE4ser f\xFCr
      die n\xE4chste Klasse."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114487
    m_Localized: "Aprende la habilidad del Mago, Bola de Fuego y el aura de la facci\xF3n
      M\xE1gica. Al final recibir\xE1s tarros de miel para la siguiente clase."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114488
    m_Localized: "D\xE9couvrez la capacit\xE9 du Magicien, Boule de feu et l'aura
      de la faction Magique. \xC0 la fin, vous recevrez des pots de miel pour la
      classe suivante."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114489
    m_Localized: Le abilita' passive, Ruba potenziamenti e il triangolo completo
      delle fazioni. Alla fine si apre il Negozio.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114490
    m_Localized: Learn about passive abilities, Steal Buffs, and the complete faction
      triangle. At the end, the Shop opens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114491
    m_Localized: "Lerne passive F\xE4higkeiten, Verst\xE4rkungen stehlen und das
      vollst\xE4ndige Fraktionsdreieck kennen. Danach \xF6ffnet sich der Shop."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114492
    m_Localized: "Aprende sobre habilidades pasivas, Robar mejoras y el tri\xE1ngulo
      completo de facciones. Al final se abrir\xE1 la Tienda."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114493
    m_Localized: "D\xE9couvrez les capacit\xE9s passives, Vol de bonus et le triangle
      complet des factions. \xC0 la fin, la Boutique s'ouvrira."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114494
    m_Localized: Come si usano i consumabili e cosa distingue la scorta dalla bisaccia.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114495
    m_Localized: Learn how to use consumables and the difference between your inventory
      and your bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114496
    m_Localized: "Lerne, wie Verbrauchsgegenst\xE4nde verwendet werden und was Vorrat
      und Tasche unterscheidet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114497
    m_Localized: Aprende a usar consumibles y la diferencia entre el inventario y
      la bolsa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114498
    m_Localized: "Apprenez \xE0 utiliser les consommables et \xE0 distinguer la r\xE9serve
      du sac."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114499
    m_Localized: 'Com''e'' fatto un capitolo: le porte, il miniboss, il boss e le
      stanze che non sono battaglie.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114500
    m_Localized: 'Learn how a chapter works: doors, the miniboss, the boss, and rooms
      that are not battles.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114501
    m_Localized: "Lerne den Aufbau eines Kapitels kennen: T\xFCren, Miniboss, Boss
      und R\xE4ume ohne K\xE4mpfe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114502
    m_Localized: "Aprende c\xF3mo funciona un cap\xEDtulo: puertas, minijefe, jefe
      y salas que no son combates."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114503
    m_Localized: "D\xE9couvrez le fonctionnement d'un chapitre : portes, mini-boss,
      boss et salles sans combat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951645114504
