  - m_Id: 6120951649308789
    m_Localized: Fondo di viaggio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308790
    m_Localized: Travel Fund
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308791
    m_Localized: Reisefonds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308792
    m_Localized: Fondo de viaje
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308793
    m_Localized: Fonds de voyage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308794
    m_Localized: "Inizi ogni run con dell'oro gi\xE0 in tasca."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308795
    m_Localized: Start each run with gold already in your purse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308796
    m_Localized: Beginne jeden Durchlauf mit Gold in deinem Beutel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308797
    m_Localized: Comienzas cada partida con oro ya en tu bolsa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308798
    m_Localized: "Commencez chaque exp\xE9dition avec de l'or dans votre bourse."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308799
    m_Localized: Mercante compiacente
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308800
    m_Localized: Kind Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308801
    m_Localized: "Gef\xE4lliger H\xE4ndler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308802
    m_Localized: Mercader complaciente
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308803
    m_Localized: Marchand complaisant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308804
    m_Localized: Al mercato le carte e i potenziamenti ti costano meno oro.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308805
    m_Localized: Cards and upgrades cost less gold at the market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308806
    m_Localized: Karten und Verbesserungen kosten auf dem Markt weniger Gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308807
    m_Localized: Las cartas y mejoras cuestan menos oro en el mercado.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308808
    m_Localized: "Les cartes et am\xE9liorations co\xFBtent moins d'or au march\xE9."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308809
    m_Localized: Smith's Temper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308810
    m_Localized: "H\xE4rte des Schmieds"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308811
    m_Localized: Temple del herrero
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308812
    m_Localized: Trempe du forgeron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308813
    m_Localized: Appena forgiato il mazzo, alcune carte a caso ottengono +1 Forza
      permanente.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308814
    m_Localized: When the deck is forged, random cards gain +1 permanent Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308815
    m_Localized: "Beim Schmieden des Decks erhalten zuf\xE4llige Karten +1 permanente
      St\xE4rke."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308816
    m_Localized: Al forjar el mazo, algunas cartas al azar obtienen +1 de Fuerza
      permanente.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308817
    m_Localized: "Une fois le deck forg\xE9, des cartes al\xE9atoires gagnent +1
      Force permanente."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308818
    m_Localized: First Deal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308819
    m_Localized: "Erstes Gesch\xE4ft"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308820
    m_Localized: Primer trato
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308821
    m_Localized: "Premi\xE8re affaire"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308822
    m_Localized: "Il primo potenziamento che compri dal mercante \xE8 gratis, una
      volta per run."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308823
    m_Localized: The first merchant upgrade you buy is free, once per run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308824
    m_Localized: "Die erste H\xE4ndlerverbesserung ist einmal pro Durchlauf kostenlos."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308825
    m_Localized: La primera mejora que compres al mercader es gratis, una vez por
      partida.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308826
    m_Localized: "La premi\xE8re am\xE9lioration achet\xE9e au marchand est gratuite,
      une fois par exp\xE9dition."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308827
    m_Localized: Avanguardia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308828
    m_Localized: Vanguard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308829
    m_Localized: Vorhut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308830
    m_Localized: Vanguardia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308831
    m_Localized: Avant-garde
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308832
    m_Localized: "Il tuo primo dado d'iniziativa vale di pi\xF9 di quello che mostra."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308833
    m_Localized: Your first initiative die counts for more than it shows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308834
    m_Localized: "Dein erster Initiativw\xFCrfel z\xE4hlt mehr, als er zeigt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308835
    m_Localized: "Tu primer dado de iniciativa vale m\xE1s de lo que muestra."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308836
    m_Localized: "Votre premier d\xE9 d'initiative vaut plus que ce qu'il affiche."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308837
    m_Localized: Fiancheggiatore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308838
    m_Localized: Flanker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308839
    m_Localized: Flankierer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308840
    m_Localized: Flanqueador
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308841
    m_Localized: Flanqueur
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308842
    m_Localized: "Anche il tuo secondo dado d'iniziativa conta di pi\xF9."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308843
    m_Localized: Your second initiative die also counts for more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308844
    m_Localized: "Auch dein zweiter Initiativw\xFCrfel z\xE4hlt mehr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308845
    m_Localized: "Tu segundo dado de iniciativa tambi\xE9n cuenta m\xE1s."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308846
    m_Localized: "Votre deuxi\xE8me d\xE9 d'initiative compte aussi davantage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308847
    m_Localized: Retroguardia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308848
    m_Localized: Rearguard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308849
    m_Localized: Nachhut
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308850
    m_Localized: Retaguardia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308851
    m_Localized: "Arri\xE8re-garde"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308852
    m_Localized: "Anche il tuo terzo dado d'iniziativa conta di pi\xF9."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308853
    m_Localized: Your third initiative die also counts for more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308854
    m_Localized: "Auch dein dritter Initiativw\xFCrfel z\xE4hlt mehr."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308855
    m_Localized: "Tu tercer dado de iniciativa tambi\xE9n cuenta m\xE1s."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308856
    m_Localized: "Votre troisi\xE8me d\xE9 d'initiative compte aussi davantage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308857
    m_Localized: Opening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308858
    m_Localized: "Er\xF6ffnung"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308859
    m_Localized: Ouverture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308860
    m_Localized: 'Sei sempre tu ad aprire lo scontro: il tuo primo dado d''iniziativa
      batte qualunque numero in campo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308861
    m_Localized: 'You always open the fight: your first initiative die beats every
      number on the field.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308862
    m_Localized: "Du er\xF6ffnest immer den Kampf: Dein erster Initiativw\xFCrfel
      schl\xE4gt jede Zahl auf dem Feld."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308863
    m_Localized: "Siempre abres el combate: tu primer dado de iniciativa supera cualquier
      n\xFAmero en el campo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308864
    m_Localized: "Vous ouvrez toujours le combat : votre premier d\xE9 d'initiative
      bat tous les nombres sur le terrain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308865
    m_Localized: Apprendista
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308866
    m_Localized: Apprentice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308867
    m_Localized: Lehrling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308868
    m_Localized: Aprendiz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308869
    m_Localized: Apprenti
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308870
    m_Localized: 'Ogni livello della run arriva prima: serve meno esperienza per
      ogni soglia.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308871
    m_Localized: 'Each run level comes sooner: every threshold needs less experience.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308872
    m_Localized: "Jede Durchlaufstufe kommt fr\xFCher: Jede Schwelle ben\xF6tigt
      weniger Erfahrung."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308873
    m_Localized: 'Cada nivel de la partida llega antes: cada umbral requiere menos
      experiencia.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308874
    m_Localized: "Chaque niveau d'exp\xE9dition arrive plus t\xF4t : chaque seuil
      demande moins d'exp\xE9rience."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308875
    m_Localized: Focus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308876
    m_Localized: Konzentration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308877
    m_Localized: "Concentraci\xF3n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308878
    m_Localized: Concentration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308879
    m_Localized: Recuperi mana ogni volta che entri in una stanza nuova.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308880
    m_Localized: Recover mana whenever you enter a new room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308881
    m_Localized: "Erhalte Mana zur\xFCck, wann immer du einen neuen Raum betrittst."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308882
    m_Localized: "Recuperas man\xE1 cada vez que entras en una nueva sala."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308883
    m_Localized: "R\xE9cup\xE9rez du mana chaque fois que vous entrez dans une nouvelle
      salle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308884
    m_Localized: "La tua riserva di mana tiene di pi\xF9: il tetto si alza da 10
      fino a 12."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308885
    m_Localized: 'Your mana reserve holds more: its cap rises from 10 to 12.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308886
    m_Localized: 'Deine Manreserve fasst mehr: Ihr Limit steigt von 10 auf 12.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308887
    m_Localized: "Tu reserva de man\xE1 aguanta m\xE1s: su l\xEDmite sube de 10 a
      12."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308888
    m_Localized: "Votre r\xE9serve de mana contient plus : son plafond passe de 10
      \xE0 12."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308889
    m_Localized: Transe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308890
    m_Localized: "La prima abilit\xE0 base che usi in ogni stanza non costa mana.
      Le supreme si pagano comunque."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308891
    m_Localized: The first basic ability used in each room costs no mana. Supremes
      still cost mana.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308892
    m_Localized: "Die erste Grundf\xE4higkeit in jedem Raum kostet kein Mana. Ultimative
      F\xE4higkeiten kosten weiterhin Mana."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308893
    m_Localized: "La primera habilidad b\xE1sica que uses en cada sala no cuesta
      man\xE1. Las supremas siguen costando man\xE1."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308894
    m_Localized: "La premi\xE8re capacit\xE9 de base utilis\xE9e dans chaque salle
      ne co\xFBte pas de mana. Les ultimes en co\xFBtent toujours."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308895
    m_Localized: Recovery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308896
    m_Localized: Wiederherstellung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308897
    m_Localized: "Recuperaci\xF3n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308898
    m_Localized: "R\xE9cup\xE9ration"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308899
    m_Localized: Al mercato, riportare una carta dal cimitero nel mazzo costa meno
      oro.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308900
    m_Localized: At the market, returning a card from the graveyard to the deck costs
      less gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308901
    m_Localized: "Auf dem Markt kostet es weniger Gold, eine Karte vom Friedhof ins
      Deck zur\xFCckzuholen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308902
    m_Localized: En el mercado, devolver una carta del cementerio al mazo cuesta
      menos oro.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308903
    m_Localized: "Au march\xE9, ramener une carte du cimeti\xE8re dans le deck co\xFBte
      moins d'or."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308904
    m_Localized: Challenger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308905
    m_Localized: Herausforderer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308906
    m_Localized: Retador
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308907
    m_Localized: "Il tuo primo attacco in ogni scontro contro un boss o un miniboss
      colpisce pi\xF9 forte."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308908
    m_Localized: Your first attack in every fight against a boss or miniboss hits
      harder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308909
    m_Localized: "Dein erster Angriff in jedem Kampf gegen einen Boss oder Miniboss
      trifft h\xE4rter."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308910
    m_Localized: "Tu primer ataque en cada combate contra un jefe o minijefe golpea
      m\xE1s fuerte."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308911
    m_Localized: "Votre premi\xE8re attaque de chaque combat contre un boss ou mini-boss
      frappe plus fort."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308912
    m_Localized: Seeker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308913
    m_Localized: Sucher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308914
    m_Localized: Buscador
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308915
    m_Localized: Chercheur
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308916
    m_Localized: "Ogni stanza bottino ti consegna consumabili in pi\xF9."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308917
    m_Localized: Every loot room grants extra consumables.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308918
    m_Localized: "Jeder Beuteraum gew\xE4hrt zus\xE4tzliche Verbrauchsgegenst\xE4nde."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308919
    m_Localized: "Cada sala de bot\xEDn concede consumibles adicionales."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308920
    m_Localized: "Chaque salle de butin accorde des consommables suppl\xE9mentaires."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308921
    m_Localized: Second Wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308922
    m_Localized: Zweiter Atem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308923
    m_Localized: Segundo aliento
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308924
    m_Localized: Second souffle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308925
    m_Localized: 'La prima pedina che perdi in ogni run non va al cimitero: torna
      subito nel mazzo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308926
    m_Localized: 'The first pawn you lose each run does not go to the graveyard:
      it returns to the deck immediately.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308927
    m_Localized: "Die erste Figur, die du pro Durchlauf verlierst, geht nicht auf
      den Friedhof: Sie kehrt sofort ins Deck zur\xFCck."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308928
    m_Localized: 'La primera ficha que pierdes en cada partida no va al cementerio:
      vuelve al mazo de inmediato.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6120951649308929
    m_Localized: "Le premier pion perdu \xE0 chaque exp\xE9dition ne va pas au cimeti\xE8re
      : il retourne imm\xE9diatement dans le deck."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
